{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BLAST 'EM UP\u00a0</strong>WITH YOUR PHONE-GUN!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626860/extras/ee651fc7358c7d800b1cc4edabd5d013.poster.avif?t=1762125343\" width=800 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626860/extras/ee651fc7358c7d800b1cc4edabd5d013.webm?t=1762125343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626860/extras/ee651fc7358c7d800b1cc4edabd5d013.mp4?t=1762125343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Protect Gloobi is an arcade-style, Souls-like FPS with a weird and offbeat vibe, where you split your focus between shredding your foes to pieces and replenishing your ammo by playing the game on your phone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle across the galaxy to earn currency and buy the perfect combination of weapons to obliterate hordes of hostile aliens! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Travel across the galaxy\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle and shred many kinds of aliens to pieces in a different world each time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be the\u00a0tech king</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obliterate your foes with many kinds of exotic phones and download different apps that change the way you play the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Don't forget to protect Gloobi</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the simple game on your phone in mid-battle to gain ammo while trying to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626860/extras/76e13fd62324b752fa06a6f4173f4ce7.poster.avif?t=1762125343\" width=800 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626860/extras/76e13fd62324b752fa06a6f4173f4ce7.webm?t=1762125343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626860/extras/76e13fd62324b752fa06a6f4173f4ce7.mp4?t=1762125343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<br><br><br><br></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3626860?t=1762125343","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626860/fd4b05a510c6d59fcbd66754cc6fa99a420982bd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762125343","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626860/201103a332d58c1dc54ca2296c3cb255e2ab3662/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762125343","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626860/201103a332d58c1dc54ca2296c3cb255e2ab3662/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762125343","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3968070,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Community event: unlock an exclusive gun </h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>join discord to unlock an exclusive gun</strong> </h2></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BLAST 'EM UP\u00a0</strong>WITH YOUR PHONE-GUN!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626860/extras/ee651fc7358c7d800b1cc4edabd5d013.poster.avif?t=1762125343\" width=800 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s